# SMITH doctrine

- Track 1 only: Automated Agent Engineering. AO is mandatory for judging demos.
- Official submit = Devpost. Discord showcase does not count.
- No mock LLM responses, no fake eval scores, no fabricated AO sessions.
- Never claim unhackable / nation-state-proof. Document residual risk honestly.
